FoamFile{version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object fvOptions;}
// A rotor at 1800 rad/s and 0.25 m radius has a 450 m/s frame velocity, so
// the MRF source terms are large and the first iterations can push T or U
// somewhere unphysical before the field settles. These bound it rather
// than letting the thermophysical model divide by a negative temperature.
limitT { type limitTemperature; active yes; selectionMode all; min 100; max 1000; }
limitU { type limitVelocity;    active yes; selectionMode all; max 800; }
